'''Deadly Carnival!''' (極ムズカーニバル！, ''Goku Muzukānibaru!'', '''Extreme Carnival!''') is a special event-chapter that was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and first appeared during the 20 Million Downloads Event. The first stage contains [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s and drops 2 [[Cat Capsule|Cat Tickets]] when cleared for the first time, while the second features enemy [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cats]] from the [[:Category:Awakening Stages|Awakening Stages]] and drops 1 Rare Cat Ticket on first completion.

